# Generated test fixtures: tests/testdata/generate_complete_testdata.py
# (re)writes these every run (CI regenerates before every test job — see
# .github/workflows/ci.yml). Untracked so they don't show perpetual `M` churn
# from embedded absolute paths / TIFF timestamps / RNG-seeded content that
# differs by machine. Hand-authored fixtures the generator does NOT write (sample_size_log*.csv,
# sample_valis_summary.csv, sample_versions.yml, sample_run_summary.json,
# sample_seg_qc.json, model_config_min.json, dummy_singularity.sif) stay tracked
# and are NOT listed here. The four that USED to be on that list --
# P001_image.tiff, P001_merged_quant.csv, P001_nuclei_mask.tif and
# P001_pyramid.ome.tiff -- were tracked at ZERO BYTES, which is how
# `nf-test --tag real` came to abort in EXTRACT_NUCLEI_PROPERTIES with
# `tifffile.TiffFileError: not a TIFF file b''`. They are generated now.
tests/testdata/P001_ref.ome.tiff
tests/testdata/P001_mov1.ome.tiff
tests/testdata/P001_mov2.ome.tiff
tests/testdata/P002_ref.ome.tiff
