# Draft figure, DELIBERATELY not part of the published supplementary set. Resolved
# 2026-09-02 (release 1.0.0, spec Phase 6, plan 11 Task 1) after the figure audit:
# it is linked from no docs page and from no sibling figure's `figset` nav, and it
# claims "Supplementary Figure S4", a number zarr-schematic.html already holds. The
# local copy was deleted. This line stays so a stray re-creation does not become a
# tracked fifth figure by accident -- and because docs/figures/*.html is globbed off
# the FILESYSTEM by tests/test_figures_match_the_pipeline.py, so an untracked file
# there fails the guard locally while CI stays green.
docs/figures/failure-schematic.html

# Research notes and literature reviews (analysis inputs, not pipeline docs).
# A plain directory rule is safe again: the one tracked report that forced the previous
# per-file enumeration (research/tma-support-2026-07-01.md, which a directory rule would
# have shadowed so that git clean and doc indexers treated it as garbage) now lives in
# docs/_archive/research/. Nothing under research/ is tracked.
/research/

# Git worktrees. Was ignored only via .git/info/exclude, which is LOCAL and never
# committed -- so on a fresh clone the whole tree showed up untracked.
.worktrees/
